          %h4#winterhalters_axiomatization Winterhalter’s axiomatization
          %p
            The axioms given in
            %a{:href => "#Winterhalter23"} Winterhalter 2023
            are in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Coq"} Coq
