            Then, we have the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/computation+rule"} computation rule
            or
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/beta-reduction"} beta-reduction
            rule. This says that for all elements
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
